"Preview includes the candidate item’s current upgrade rank, socketed gems, replaced equipment and currently implemented runtime bonuses. Nothing is changed.":["Preview includes the candidate item’s current upgrade rank, socketed gems, replaced equipment and currently implemented runtime bonuses. Nothing is changed.","Die Vorschau berücksichtigt Verbesserungsrang, Edelsteine, ersetzte Ausrüstung und aktuelle Boni. Es wird nichts geändert.","La vista previa incluye rango, gemas, equipo reemplazado y bonificaciones actuales. No cambia nada.","Het voorbeeld omvat rang, edelstenen, vervangen uitrusting en huidige bonussen. Er verandert niets.","L’anteprima include grado, gemme, equipaggiamento sostituito e bonus attuali. Nulla viene modificato.","L’aperçu inclut rang, gemmes, équipement remplacé et bonus actuels. Rien n’est modifié."],
