"Combat rewards first arrive as unrefined family gems. Enchanting refines them before they can be socketed; Effect Resonance remains capped at III.":["Combat rewards first arrive as unrefined family gems. Enchanting refines them before they can be socketed; Effect Resonance remains capped at III.","Kampfbelohnungen liefern zunächst rohe Familienedelsteine. Verzaubern veredelt sie zum Einsetzen; Effektresonanz bleibt auf III begrenzt.","Las recompensas de combate dan gemas sin refinar. Encantamiento las refina para engarzarlas; la resonancia de efecto se limita a III.","Gevechtsbeloningen geven eerst ruwe familie-edelstenen. Betoveren verfijnt ze voor gebruik; effectresonantie blijft beperkt tot III.","Il combattimento dà gemme grezze. Incantamento le raffina per incastonarle; la risonanza effetto resta limitata a III.","Le combat donne des gemmes brutes. Enchantement les raffine avant sertissage ; la résonance d’effet reste limitée à III."],
